---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 5, 2026';
---

<Layout
	title="Cookie Policy | AlisPro MediTours"
	description="What cookies alispromeditours.com uses, why, and how to manage your preferences."
>
	<PageHeader title="Cookie Policy" subtitle={`Last updated: ${lastUpdated}`} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookie Policy' }]} />

	<section class="legal-page">
		<div class="legal-page__inner">
			<p>
				This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, which ones alispromeditours.com (the "Site") uses, and how
				you can manage your preferences. It should be read together with our{' '}
				<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
			<p>
				Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They let a site remember
				information about your visit, such as your preferences, or help site owners understand how their site is
				used.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Cookies We Use</h2>
			<p>
				We use two categories of cookies. <strong>Necessary</strong> cookies are required for the Site to work
				and don't need your consent. <strong>Analytics</strong> cookies are optional and only set if you agree to
				them in the consent banner.
			</p>

			<table class="legal-page__table">
				<thead>
					<tr>
						<th>Cookie</th>
						<th>Category</th>
						<th>Purpose</th>
						<th>Duration</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td><code>site_locale</code></td>
						<td>Necessary</td>
						<td>Remembers the language you selected, so we don't ask again on your next visit.</td>
						<td>1 year</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><code>cc_consent</code></td>
						<td>Necessary</td>
						<td>Remembers your cookie-consent choice, so the banner doesn't reappear every visit.</td>
						<td>1 year</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>, <code>_gid</code></td>
						<td>Analytics</td>
						<td>
							Set by Google Analytics (only if you accept Analytics cookies) to distinguish visitors and measure
							site usage, so we can understand what's working and improve the Site.
						</td>
						<td>Up to 2 years (set by Google)</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>

			<h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
			<p>
				When Analytics cookies are enabled, Google Analytics may set its own cookies as described above. Google's
				use of this data is governed by Google's own privacy policy. We do not control third-party cookies
				directly and recommend reviewing the relevant provider's policy for full detail.
			</p>

			<h2>4. Managing Your Preferences</h2>
			<p>
				You chose your cookie preferences the first time you visited the Site. You can change that choice at any
				time:
			</p>
			<button type="button" class="legal-page__cookie-btn" id="open-cookie-settings">Manage Cookie Preferences</button>
			<p>
				You can also block or delete cookies through your browser's settings, though doing so may affect how
				parts of the Site function (for example, your language preference won't be remembered).
			</p>

			<h2>5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the
				"Last updated" date above.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about this Cookie Policy can be sent to{' '}
				<a href="mailto:care@alispromeditours.com">care@alispromeditours.com</a>.
			</p>

			<p class="legal-page__disclaimer">
				This policy is provided for general informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice. It
				should be reviewed by a qualified attorney before being relied upon as a complete compliance document.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<script>
	document.getElementById('open-cookie-settings')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
		document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cc:open'));
	});
</script>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		background: var(--color-bg-white);
		padding: 56px 24px 88px;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.legal-page__inner {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.legal-page__inner p {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin: 0 0 18px;
	}

	.legal-page__inner h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 20px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin: 36px 0 14px;
	}

	.legal-page__inner a {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.legal-page__table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		font-size: 13.5px;
	}

	.legal-page__table th,
	.legal-page__table td {
		text-align: left;
		padding: 10px 12px;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
		vertical-align: top;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
	}

	.legal-page__table th {
		background: var(--color-bg-soft-blue);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.legal-page__table code {
		font-size: 12.5px;
		background: var(--color-bg-soft-blue);
		padding: 2px 6px;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.legal-page__cookie-btn {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--btn-primary-text);
		background: var(--btn-primary-bg);
		border: none;
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 12px 24px;
		cursor: pointer;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.legal-page__cookie-btn:hover {
		background: var(--btn-primary-hover);
	}

	.legal-page__disclaimer {
		margin-top: 40px;
		padding-top: 20px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-style: italic;
	}
</style>
